}", "type": "code", "heading": "Hexadecimal Example"}, {"type": "code_practice", "context": "Declare a variable 'hexColor' of type char array, initialize it with "AABBCC", and convert it to an integer 'decimalColor'. Use sscanf with "%x".", "heading": "Hexadecimal to Decimal", "code_after": "", "code_before": "#include <stdio.h>
